MODAL: {"cls": "normalmode popupoff ReactModal__Body--open", "html": "<body class=\"normalmode popupoff ReactModal__Body--open\" id=\"main\"><div data-react-modal-body-trap=\"\" tabindex=\"0\" style=\"position: absolute; opacity: 0;\"></div><div id=\"wrap\" class=\"wrap\" style=\"height:100%\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div id=\"accessibility\" style=\"display: block;\" data-accessibility-ready=\"true\"><a href=\"#container\" tabindex=\"0\">본문 바로가기</a><a href=\"#header\" tabindex=\"0\">주메뉴 바로가기</a></div><header id=\"header\" tabindex=\"-1\"><div><div class=\"header_wrap main_header_wrap\"><div class=\"top_popup_wrap\"><div class=\"top_popup\"><div class=\"slick-slider top_popup_inner slick-initialized\"><div class=\"slick-list\"><div class=\"slick-track\" style=\"opacity: 1; transform: translate3d(0px, 0px, 0px);\"><div data-index=\"0\" class=\"slick-slide slick-active slick-current\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-hidden=\"false\" style=\"outline: none; width: 0px;\"><div><a class=\"slide_detail\" href=\"https://www.korail.com/ticket/main\" target=\"_self\" title=\"열기\" tabindex=\"0\" style=\"width: 100%; display: inline-block;\"><li>홈페이지 로그인이 안되시는 분은 인터넷 기록을 삭제 후 재접속해 주시기 바랍니다.</li></a></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"ctrlbtn\"><button class=\"stop\" style=\"display: inline-block;\">일시정지</button></div><div class=\"toppopclose\"><button class=\"topclose_btn\"><span class=\"blind\">팝업 닫기</span></button></div></div></div><div class=\"header_inner\"><div class=\"header_top\"><div class=\"content_inner clear\"><ul class=\"h_top_left\"><li><a href=\"https://info.korail.com/info/index.do\" title=\"코레일 기업홍보 사이트로 이동\">한국철도</a></li><li class=\"active\"><a href=\"/ticket/main\" title=\"코레일 승차권예매 사이트로 이동\">승차권예매</a></li><li class=\"\"><a href=\"/tour/main\" title=\"코레일 기차여행 사이트로 이동\">기차여행</a></li></ul><ul class=\"h_top_right\"><li><a href=\"/\">HOME</a></li><li><a class=\"btnGoLogin\" href=\"/ticket/login\">로그인</a></li><li class=\"loginY\"><a href=\"/ticket/mypage/cart\">장바구니</a><